    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8230;</mo></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;are A.P. and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>10</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
